{"unit_id":"2540511__dsh-memory#card-zh","repo":"2540511/dsh-memory","commit":"7cc749fb0e023ae3a533571ff17c09c4821ec005","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory 是一个 DSH Web 端长期记忆插件，可把会话保存为工作区中的 Markdown 记忆。它通过插件页和宿主路由管理记忆，并将摘要、检索与文件操作放在本地模块中处理。聊天模式会抽取会话要点并生成完整版本；工作模式逐字保存会话、记录文件变更并在内容较大时分卷。启动索引可压缩常用记忆，用户还能搜索条目、处理待确认记忆，并导入或导出记忆文件。适合希望跨会话保存和查找本地工作记录的 DSH 用户；无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:12-49","src/compose.js:1-35","src/workmem.js:1-15","src/search.js:1-15"]}
{"unit_id":"2540511__dsh-memory#card-en","repo":"2540511/dsh-memory","commit":"7cc749fb0e023ae3a533571ff17c09c4821ec005","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-memory saves DSH sessions as local Markdown. Chat mode extracts key passages and keeps a full version; work mode records conversations verbatim and splits large records. Users can search entries and carry a compact index into later sessions. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:12-49","src/compose.js:1-35","src/workmem.js:1-15","src/search.js:1-15"]}
